  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "酸味と　苦味が　ある　食材。青臭さを　活かすなら　コクのある食材と一緒に　サンドすると　よい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "신맛과 쓴맛이 나는 식재료. 진한 맛이 나는 식재료와 같이 샌드위치에 넣으면 풋내를 살릴 수 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "帶有酸味和苦味的食材。如欲活用其青草味，可連同滋味濃郁的食材一起夾進麵包。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrédient au goût amer et acide. La meilleure façon de mettre en valeur sa saveur fraîche est de le combiner avec des ingrédients au goût prononcé.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Der frische Geschmack dieser säuerlich-bitteren Zutat lässt sich am besten in Szene setzen, indem man sie mit reichhaltigen Zutaten in einem Sandwich kombiniert.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ingrediente ácido y amargo a la vez. Se recomienda combinarlo con algún otro de sabor fuerte para sacar el máximo partido a su intenso sabor a verdura.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente aspro e amaro. Le sue fresche note vegetali ben si sposano con gli ingredienti dal gusto più corposo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A tart and bitter ingredient. Using it together with rich- tasting ingredients in a sandwich will really make the most of a cucumber’s fresh-veggie aroma.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "酸味と　苦味が　ある　食材。青臭さを　活かすなら　コクのある食材と一緒に　サンドすると　よい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "带有酸味和苦味的食材。想要活用其草腥味的话，就和味道浓厚的食材一起做成三明治吧。",
